-label\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">24/7 SOC on your telemetry</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">GRC &amp; Compliance</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA, NIS2</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services/custom-software\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Custom Software</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Systems built to survive an audit</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Engagement Models</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">How retainers and projects actually run</span></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__panel-foot\"><a class=\"nav__panel-all\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services\">All <!-- -->services<!-- --> →</a></div></div></li><li><button id=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Industries\" data-state=\"closed\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Industries\" class=\"nav__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Industries<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down nav__trigger-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Industries\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Industries\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"nav__panel\" style=\"pointer-events:none\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"nav__panel-grid\"><ul class=\"nav__links\"><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/industries/financial-services\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Financial Services</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/industries/healthcare\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Healthcare</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/industries/saas\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/industries/logistics\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Logistics</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/industries/public-sector\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Public Sector</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/industries/retail\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__panel-foot\"><a class=\"nav__panel-all\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/industries\">All <!-- -->industries<!-- --> →</a></div></div></li><li><button id=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Proof\" data-state=\"closed\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Proof\" class=\"nav__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Proof<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down nav__trigger-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Proof\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Proof\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"nav__panel\" style=\"pointer-events:none\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"nav__panel-grid\"><a class=\"nav__featured\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/sample-report\"><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Start here</span><span class=\"nav__featured-label\">Anatomy of a report</span><span class=\"nav__featured-blurb\">Walk a real deliverable, redacted. See what actually lands in your inbox.</span></a><ul class=\"nav__links\"><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Case Studies</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">24 stories, filterable</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/customers\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Customers</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Who we work with, and what they say</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/certifications\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Certifications</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Ours, with certificate numbers</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/trust\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Trust Centre</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Our own security posture, published</span></a></li></ul></div></div></li><li><button id=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Resources\" data-state=\"closed\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Resources\" class=\"nav__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down nav__trigger-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Resources\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Resources\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"nav__panel\" style=\"pointer-events:none\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"nav__panel-grid\"><ul class=\"nav__links\"><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/resources\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">All resources</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/blog\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Insights</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-i