tions\"><a class=\"nav__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"nav\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone nav__hotline-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"nav__hotline-text\"><span class=\"nav__hotline-kicker\">Breach? 24/7</span><span class=\"nav__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--sm nav__cta\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><details class=\"nav__mobile\"><summary class=\"nav__burger\" aria-label=\"Navigation menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu nav__burger-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x nav__burger-close\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"nav__sheet\" aria-label=\"All pages\"><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Services</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/devsecops\">Secure SDLC<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">The page that explains why one firm does both. Start here.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">Software Development</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">Engagement Models</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services\">All <!-- -->services</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Industries</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/financial-services\">Financial Services</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/healthcare\">Healthcare</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/saas\">SaaS &amp; Technology</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/logistics\">Logistics</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/public-sector\">Public Sector</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/retail\">Retail &amp; Payments</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries\">All <!-- -->industries</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Proof</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Anatomy of a report<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">Walk a real deliverable, redacted. See what actually lands in your inbox.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Resources</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/resources\">All resources</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/tools\">Open-source tools</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/methodologies\">Methodologies</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Company</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md btn--full\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"nav__sheet-hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\">Incident response, 24/7 — <!-- -->+44 20 4525 9100</a></div></nav></details></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/services#collection\",\"name\":\"Services\",\"description\":\"Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"numberOfItems\":18,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Penetration Testing\",\"description\":\"Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/penetration-testing\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Application Security\",\"description\":\"Secure code review, CI gates and threat models that engineers will actually maintain.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/application-security\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Cloud Security\",\"description\":\"Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cloud-security\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"GRC & Compliance\",\"description\":\"SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA and NIS2, evidenced from systems you already run.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/grc-compliance\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Managed Detection & Response\",\"description\":\"24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/managed-detection-response\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Incident Response\",\"description\":\"24/7 hotline answered by a responder. Retainer or emergency.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/incident-response\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"name\":\"Red Teaming\",\"description\":\"Objective-based adversary simulation, with a purple-team debrief that transfers the knowledge.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/red-teaming\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"name\":\"vCISO\",\"description\":\"Fractional security leadership, with an explicit plan to make itself redundant.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/vciso\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":9,\"name\":\"Custom Software\",\"description\":\"Production systems with authorisation, audit and secrets handled properly from the first commit.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/custom-software\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":10,\"name\":\"Web Application Development\",\"description\":\"Server-rendered, budget-enforced front ends that work before JavaScript arrives.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/web-application-development\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":11,\"name\":\"Platform & DevOps\",\"description\":\"Reproducible infrastructure, short-lived pipeline identity, and a rehearsed rollback.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/platform-engineering\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":12,\"name\":\"ERP\",\"description\":\"Finance, inventory and procurement modelled on your exceptions, with history reconciled.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/erp\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":13,\"name\":\"CRM\",\"description\":\"Pipeline, activity and forecasting designed so sellers get something back from every field.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/crm\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":14,\"name\":\"HRM\",\"description\":\"Field-level access control, read-auditing, and joiner-mover-leaver flows that complete.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/hrm\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":15,\"name\":\"LMS\",\"description\":\"Audit-grade completion evidence with content people finish inside the window.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/lms\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":16,\"name\":\"QA & Test Automation\",\"description\":\"Deterministic end-to-end suites with a flake budget and a quarantine process.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/qa-automation\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":17,\"name\":\"Secure SDLC\",\"description\":\"One firm, two practices, one backlog. The seam between build and break, removed.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/devsecops\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":18,\"name\":\"Engagement Models\",\"description\":\"Projects, programmes, retainers and embedded teams — and which of them you do not need.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/engagement-models\"}]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Envenox\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Services\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/services\"}]}</script><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" style=\"padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--s16))\" aria-labelledby=\"services-h1\"><div class=\"u-container\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-hero__eyebrow\">Services</p><h1 id=\"services-h1\" class=\"sv-h1 sv-h1--long\">Cybersecurity and Software Development</h1><p class=\"sv-sub\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><p class=\"sv-lede\">Projects, programmes, retainers and embedded teams — and which of them you do not need.</p><div class=\"sv-hero__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><span>Why one firm does both — Secure SDLC</span></a></div><ul class=\"sv-hero__meta\"><li>A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</li><li>8 cybersecurity services</li><li>8 engineering services</li></ul></div></section><nav class=\"sv-jump theme-deep\" aria-label=\"Jump to a section of this page\"><div class=\"u-container sv-jump__inner\"><a class=\"sv-jump__link\" href=\"#cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a><a class=\"sv-jump__link\" href=\"#secure-sdlc\">Secure SDLC</a><a class=\"sv-jump__link\" href=\"#software-engineering\">Software Development</a><a class=\"sv-jump__link\" href=\"#engagement-models\">Engagement Models</a><a class=\"sv-jump__link\" href=\"#proof\">Proof</a><a class=\"sv-jump__link\" href=\"#faq\">Questions</a><a class=\"sv-jump__link\" href=\"#enquiry-form\">Start a conversation</a></div></nav><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"pillars-h2\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">How the work divides</p><h2 id=\"pillars-h2\" class=\"sv-h2\">Two pillars, and the seam between them</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Threat models shape the build. The build gets attacked. The attack rewrites the threat model.</p></div><div class=\"sv-seam\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-seam__col\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-seam__kicker\">Pillar one</p><h3 class=\"sv-seam__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></h3><p class=\"sv-seam__line\">Testing, assurance, detection and response — by people who also ship production software.</p><p class=\"sv-seam__body\">Our testers are not career report-writers. They have shipped systems, which is why their findings arrive with a fix an engineer will accept rather than a recommendation an engineer has to translate.</p><p class=\"sv-seam__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">8 services</span></p></div><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-seam__col sv-seam__centre\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-seam__kicker\">The seam</p><h3 class=\"sv-seam__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:var(--s2)\"><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"15\"></line><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg>Secure SDLC</a></h3><p class=\"sv-seam__line\">We build it and we break it. The findings land in our own sprint backlog.</p><p class=\"sv-seam__body\">One firm, two practices, one backlog. The seam between build and break, removed.</p><p class=\"sv-seam__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">9 days median</span></p></div><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-seam__col\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-seam__kicker\">Pillar two</p><h3 class=\"sv-seam__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">Software Development</a></h3><p class=\"sv-seam__line\">Products, platforms and business systems built to survive an audit and a handover.</p><p class=\"sv-seam__body\">Our engineers work next to a security practice that will attack what they build. That changes how authorisation, audit logging and secrets get designed — before the first commit rather than after the first report.</p><p class=\"sv-seam__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--neutral\">8 services</span></p></div></div><div id=\"secure-sdlc\" class=\"sv-head\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s16);margin-bottom:0\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">We build it and we break it. The findings land in our own sprint backlog.</h3><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">The standard arrangement is that a development firm builds your software for forty weeks and a security firm tests it in week forty-one. Everything that test finds is now expensive, because the architecture is set, the team is rolling off, and a finding that requires a design change arrives after the design is load-bearing. Both firms behaved correctly and the outcome is still bad. Our two practices run against each other continuously instead: our testers review the design before it is built, read the code as it is written, and raise findings into the same backlog our engineers work from. The number that matters is the nine days between a finding being confirmed and the fix being live, and it is only possible because there is no handover in the middle.</p><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><span>Read Secure SDLC</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"cybersecurity\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Pillar one</p><h2 id=\"cybersecurity\" class=\"sv-h2\">Cybersecurity</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Testing, assurance, detection and response — by people who also ship production software.</p></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--3\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bug sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v-9\"></path><path d=\"M14 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0v-3a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z\"></path><path d=\"M14.12 3.88 16 2\"></path><path d=\"M21 21a4 4 0 0 0-3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 5a4 4 0 0 1-3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M22 13h-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 21a4 4 0 0 1 3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 5a4 4 0 0 0 3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M6 13H2\"></path><path d=\"m8 2 1.88 1.88\"></path><path d=\"M9 7.13V6a3 3 0 1 1 6 0v1.13\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Technical report — every finding with CVSS v4.0 vector, affected component, reproduction path, raw request/response evidence, and a remediation we would accept in code review</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Executive summary — two pages, written for a board, with the risk narrative and the three decisions that matter</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Findings register as CSV and JSON, keyed for direct import into Jira, Linear or ServiceNow</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Penetration Testing<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code2 lucide-file-code-2 sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m5 12-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m9 18 3-3-3-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Secure code review, CI gates and threat models that engineers will actually maintain.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Threat model per bounded context, authored by your engineers, in your repository</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Code review findings as pull request comments plus tickets in your tracker</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Working CI configuration for SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning, with the tuning rationale documented</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View AppSec<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Identity graph with every privilege-escalation and lateral-movement path, as a diagram and as queryable data</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Configuration findings filtered to what is exploitable in your topology, with CIS benchmark mapping</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection coverage matrix against MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Cloud Security<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scroll-text sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 12h-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 8h-5\"></path><path d=\"M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA and NIS2, evidenced from systems you already run.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Readiness report with a costed, ordered gap list</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Risk methodology, risk register and Statement of Applicability</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Policy set written for your organisation, not a template pack</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View GRC &amp; Compliance<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection repository, version-controlled, mapped to MITRE ATT&amp;CK, yours to keep</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Validated log source inventory with coverage gaps named</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Incident runbook with agreed containment authority and escalation paths</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View MDR<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-siren sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 18v-6a5 5 0 1 1 10 0v6\"></path><path d=\"M5 21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M21 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M18.5 4.5 18 5\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v1\"></path><path d=\"m4.929 4.929.707.707\"></path><path d=\"M12 12v6\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">24/7 hotline answered by a responder. Retainer or emergency.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Incident timeline with evidence references and chain of custody</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Root cause analysis naming the control that failed and the control that would have caught it</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Indicators of compromise, with detections to prevent recurrence</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Incident Response<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-swords sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"14.5 17.5 3 6 3 3 6 3 17.5 14.5\"></polyline><line x1=\"13\" x2=\"19\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"20\"></line><line x1=\"19\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"19\"></line><polyline points=\"14.5 6.5 18 3 21 3 21 6 17.5 9.5\"></polyline><line x1=\"5\" x2=\"9\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"7\" x2=\"4\" y1=\"17\" y2=\"20\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"5\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Objective-based adversary simulation, with a purple-team debrief that transfers the knowledge.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Attack narrative with a full timeline and the evidence for each step</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection and response assessment: what fired, what did not, and how long each decision took</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Technique-by-technique ATT&amp;CK mapping with your coverage marked</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Red Teaming<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user-cog sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 15H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"m14.305 16.53.923-.382\"></path><path d=\"m15.228 13.852-.923-.383\"></path><path d=\"m16.852 12.228-.383-.923\"></path><path d=\"m16.852 17.772-.383.924\"></path><path d=\"m19.148 12.228.383-.923\"></path><path d=\"m19.53 18.696-.382-.924\"></path><path d=\"m20.772 13.852.924-.383\"></path><path d=\"m20.772 16.148.924.383\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Fractional security leadership, with an explicit plan to make itself redundant.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Posture assessment and costed risk baseline</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Board-ready security strategy and quarterly reporting pack</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Risk register with owners, treatments and closure dates</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View vCISO<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Everything under Cybersecurity</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"software-engineering\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Pillar two</p><h2 id=\"software-engineering\" class=\"sv-h2\">Software Development</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Products, platforms and business systems built to survive an audit and a handover.</p></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--3\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Production systems with authorisation, audit and secrets handled properly from the first commit.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Working software in production, with the source in your repository under your licence</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Architecture decision records explaining why, not just what</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Threat model and a clean penetration test report at go-live</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Custom Software<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Application Development</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Server-rendered, budget-enforced front ends that work before JavaScript arrives.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Production application with the source in your repository</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Styleguide route rendering every component in every theme and state</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Performance budgets wired into CI with the rationale documented</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Web Applications<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-server sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"8\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><rect width=\"20\" height=\"8\" x=\"2\" y=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Reproducible infrastructure, short-lived pipeline identity, and a rehearsed rollback.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Infrastructure as code, reproducible from an empty account, in your repository</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>CI/CD pipeline with short-lived identity and automated rollback</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Service level objectives with error budgets and alerting that requires action</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Platform &amp; DevOps<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Finance, inventory and procurement modelled on your exceptions, with history reconciled.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Process documentation as implemented, including exception handling</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Configured and tested system with role-based access and segregation of duties</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Migration reconciliation reports signed off by finance</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View ERP<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Pipeline, activity and forecasting designed so sellers get something back from every field.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Configured CRM with the agreed data model and stage definitions</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Automatic activity capture from email, calendar and telephony</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Forecast model with visible assumptions</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View CRM<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-handshake sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4\"></path><path d=\"m21 3 1 11h-2\"></path><path d=\"M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 4h8\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/hrm\">HRM</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Field-level access control, read-auditing, and joiner-mover-leaver flows that complete.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Configured system with field-level access control and read-auditing</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Data protection impact assessment and a records-of-processing entry</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Joiner-mover-leaver orchestration with completion tracking</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View HRM<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/lms\">LMS</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Audit-grade completion evidence with content people finish inside the window.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Learning platform with authoring, versioning and SCORM/xAPI support</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Rule-based assignment engine with recurrence and escalation</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Audit-grade completion evidence, exportable</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View LMS<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-test-tube-diagonal sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 7 6.82 21.18a2.83 2.83 0 0 1-3.99-.01a2.83 2.83 0 0 1 0-4L17 3\"></path><path d=\"m16 2 6 6\"></path><path d=\"M12 16H4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/qa-automation\">QA &amp; Test Automation</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Deterministic end-to-end suites with a flake budget and a quarantine process.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Written test strategy including what is deliberately not automated</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>End-to-end suite covering the critical journeys, with isolated test data</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>CI configuration with parallelisation, sharding and failure artefacts</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View QA &amp; Test Automation<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">Everything under Software Development</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"engagement-models\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Commercial shape</p><h2 id=\"engagement-models\" class=\"sv-h2\">Engagement Models</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">How a security retainer and a delivery retainer actually differ, stated plainly.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><p class=\"sv-lede\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s4)\">Security retainers and software retainers are both called retainers and they behave nothing alike. A security retainer buys reserved capacity against an unpredictable need — you hope not to use the incident hours. A delivery retainer buys a standing team against a predictable need — if you do not use the capacity, you have wasted it. Blurring the two is how a client ends up paying for a dedicated squad to handle incidents that happen twice a year, or expecting an incident retainer to absorb a six-month build. This page exists so the distinction is clear before the commercial conversation, not during it.</p><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\"><span>How the four models differ</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--2\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Fixed-scope project</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">A bounded piece of work with a defined output: a penetration test, a cloud review, a discovery phase. Fixed price where the scope is genuinely knowable.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Programme</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Multi-phase work with a defined destination — a certification, a platform uplift, a system replacement. Priced by phase, reviewed monthly.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Security retainer</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Reserved capacity: testing days each quarter, incident hours, and advisory access. Priced on availability, because availability is what you are buying.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Embedded team</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">A standing squad on a quarterly commitment, working in your process, in your repository, in your stand-up.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"proof\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Capacity</p><h2 id=\"proof\" class=\"sv-h2\">The firm behind the services</h2></div><ul class=\"statbar statbar--4\" aria-label=\"Envenox at a glance\"><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">38</span></span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">engineers and testers on staff</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Internal headcount register · as of 2026-10-01</p></details></li><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">11</span></span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">years operating</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Companies House incorporation record · as of 2026-01-01</p></details></li><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">240</span></span><span class=\"stat__suffix\">+</span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">engagements delivered</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Delivery system export · as of 2026-10-01</p></details></li><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">71</span></span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">net promoter score</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Post-engagement survey, 94 responses · as of 2026-09-30</p></details></li></ul><div style=\"margin-top:var(--s16)\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\">Selected clients</p><div class=\"marquee\" style=\"--gap:var(--s12);--marquee-dur:52s\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><ul class=\"marquee__track mq-track\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"router\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Not sure what you need?</p><h2 id=\"router\" class=\"sv-h2\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Tell us what you are trying to achieve and what constrains it. If what you need is not what you asked for, we will say so on the first call rather than in month three — we have told clients to buy two penetration tests instead of the red team they came for, and to buy a package instead of the custom build.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-handshake\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\"><path d=\"m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4\"></path><path d=\"m21 3 1 11h-2\"></path><path d=\"M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 4h8\"></path></svg><p class=\"sv-lede\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s4)\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><div class=\"sv-hero__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a></div></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><ul class=\"sv-links\" aria-label=\"Where to start\"><li><a class=\"sv-links__a\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><span class=\"sv-links__label\">Secure SDLC<span class=\"sv-links__blurb\">One firm, two practices, one backlog. The seam between build and break, removed.</span></span><svg class=\"sv-links__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"sv-links__a\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\"><span class=\"sv-links__label\">Cybersecurity<span class=\"sv-links__blurb\">Testing, assurance, detection and response — by people who also ship production software.</span></span><svg class=\"sv-links__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"sv-links__a\" href=\"/services/software-development\"><span class=\"sv-links__label\">Software Development<span class=\"sv-links__blurb\">Products, platforms and business systems built to survive an audit and a handover.</span></span><svg class=\"sv-links__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"sv-links__a\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\"><span class=\"sv-links__label\">Engagement Models<span class=\"sv-links__blurb\">Projects, programmes, retainers and embedded teams — and which of them you do not need.</span></span><svg class=\"sv-links__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"sv-links__a\" href=\"/sample-report\"><span class=\"sv-links__label\">Walk a sample report<span class=\"sv-links__blurb\">See what actually lands in your inbox before you buy one.</span></span><svg class=\"sv-links__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Before you ask</p><h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"sv-h2\">Questions buyers ask</h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it a conflict of interest to test your own build?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It would be if the same person did both, so they do not. The pre-release test is led by a tester who has not contributed code, the report comes to you unedited, and a third reviewer signs it. We will also support an independent third-party test and share the threat model with them — our commercial interest in a clean report is exactly why your structural scepticism is correct.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we start with one test and expand?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most clients do, and it is the sensible order. A single test tells you whether you want to work with us before either side commits to a programme.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you work fixed price?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For bounded work with a knowable scope, yes — tests, reviews, discovery phases. For a build, time and materials against a prioritised backlog with a cap and a monthly review, because a fixed price for an undesigned build is priced for the worst case and then spent defending the scope boundary.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does an incident retainer actually reserve?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Hours, a response time, pre-agreed rates, a pre-signed NDA, and a team that has already read your architecture. The last of those is the one that saves the most time in hour one, and it is the one you cannot buy during an incident.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we buy security and software on one agreement?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and it is the common case. One master services agreement, separate statements of work per engagement, one account team. The pre-release test is still signed by someone independent of the build.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you apply this to our in-house team?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and it is a common engagement. The security practice embeds with your delivery team, the gates and the backlog are yours, and the goal is that your engineers own the model within two quarters. We bring the testers; you keep the capability.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does this replace a penetration test?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No — it contains one, and adds the continuous work around it. If you only want the point-in-time measurement, buy the test on its own; it is a legitimate purchase. This is for building a system that passes it.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"\"><div class=\"faq faq__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_ium5fiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_2um5fiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Is it a conflict of interest to test your own build?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_ium5fiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_2um5fiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_kum5fiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_4um5fiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Can we start with one test and expand?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kum5fiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_4um5fiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_mum5fiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_6um5fiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Do you work fixed price?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_mum5fiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_6um5fiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_oum5fiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_8um5fiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>What does an incident retainer actually reserve?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_oum5fiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_8um5fiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_qum5fiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_aum5fiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Can we buy security and software on one agreement?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_qum5fiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_aum5fiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_sum5fiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_cum5fiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Can you apply this to our in-house team?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_sum5fiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_cum5fiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_uum5fiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_eum5fiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Does this replace a penetration test?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_uum5fiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_eum5fiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div><dl class=\"faq__nojs\"><div><dt>Is it a conflict of interest to test your own build?</dt><dd>It would be if the same person did both, so they do not. The pre-release test is led by a tester who has not contributed code, the report comes to you unedited, and a third reviewer signs it. We will also support an independent third-party test and share the threat model with them — our commercial interest in a clean report is exactly why your structural scepticism is correct.</dd></div><div><dt>Can we start with one test and expand?</dt><dd>Most clients do, and it is the sensible order. A single test tells you whether you want to work with us before either side commits to a programme.</dd></div><div><dt>Do you work fixed price?</dt><dd>For bounded work with a knowable scope, yes — tests, reviews, discovery phases. For a build, time and materials against a prioritised backlog with a cap and a monthly review, because a fixed price for an undesigned build is priced for the worst case and then spent defending the scope boundary.</dd></div><div><dt>What does an incident retainer actually reserve?</dt><dd>Hours, a response time, pre-agreed rates, a pre-signed NDA, and a team that has already read your architecture. The last of those is the one that saves the most time in hour one, and it is the one you cannot buy during an incident.</dd></div><div><dt>Can we buy security and software on one agreement?</dt><dd>Yes, and it is the common case. One master services agreement, separate statements of work per engagement, one account team. The pre-release test is still signed by someone independent of the build.</dd></div><div><dt>Can you apply this to our in-house team?</dt><dd>Yes, and it is a common engagement. The security practice embeds with your delivery team, the gates and the backlog are yours, and the goal is that your engineers own the model within two quarters. We bring the testers; you keep the capability.</dd></div><div><dt>Does this replace a penetration test?</dt><dd>No — it contains one, and adds the continuous work around it. If you only want the point-in-time measurement, buy the test on its own; it is a legitimate purchase. This is for building a system that passes it.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-h2\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"enquiry-h2\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><p class=\"sv-note\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><form class=\"sv-form\" id=\"enquiry-form\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_ID_403c44504416ed33d4af4350092b655f174641e336\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"returnTo\" value=\"/services\"/><div id=\"enquiry-incomplete\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>Some required fields came through empty. They are marked below — fill them in and send again.</p></div><div id=\"enquiry-email\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>That email address did not look complete. Check it and send again.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-name\">Your name<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-name\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"name\" name=\"name\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-email\">Business email<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-email\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"enq-email-help\" name=\"email\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-email-help\">We reply from a person, not a no-reply address.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-company\">Company<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-company\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"organization\" name=\"company\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-country\">Country<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-country\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"country-name\" aria-describedby=\"enq-country-help\" name=\"country\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-country-help\">Relevant for data residency and time zone.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-interest\">What is this about<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><select id=\"enq-interest\" name=\"interest\" class=\"sv-select\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"penetration-testing\">Penetration testing</option><option value=\"application-security\">Application security programme</option><option value=\"cloud-security\">Cloud security review</option><option value=\"grc-compliance\">SOC 2 / ISO 27001 / PCI DSS</option><option value=\"managed-detection-response\">Managed detection &amp; response</option><option value=\"red-teaming\">Red team</option><option value=\"vciso\">vCISO</option><option value=\"custom-software\">Custom software build</option><option value=\"web-application-development\">Web application</option><option value=\"platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</option><option value=\"business-systems\">ERP / CRM / HRM / LMS</option><option value=\"devsecops\">Secure SDLC — build and test together</option><option value=\"not-sure\">Not sure yet — help me work it out</option></select></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-message\">What are you trying to achieve, and what is the deadline<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"enq-message\" name=\"message\" class=\"sv-textarea\" rows=\"5\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-message-help\"></textarea><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-message-help\">Two or three sentences is plenty. The constraint is usually more useful than the requirement.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field sv-field--check\"><input id=\"enq-consent\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sv-check\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-consent-help\" name=\"consent\"/><span><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-consent\">I agree to Envenox contacting me about this enquiry.<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-consent-help\">We keep enquiry details for 24 months from last contact and never share them. See the privacy notice.</p></span></div><p class=\"sv-help\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sv-req\">*</span> <!-- -->Required.</p><div class=\"sv-form__actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\"><span>Send an enquiry</span></button><p class=\"sv-form__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-cta-band\"><div><h2 class=\"sv-h2\">The Adversary Loop</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">Threat models shape the build. The build gets attacked. The attack rewrites the threat model.</p></div><div class=\"sv-cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/approach\"><span>Read how we work</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span>See the work</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 